  "source_sha256": "23096022dbfdefd767447a4d43d316c6d7fdd5993d186a23528f40894fb9a2bd",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b3ad0d9429ddf23a473d576337646677b8697058fff30f556a5d8e56b8439242",
      "text": "Jade Rabbit’s\nFirst Ballet Class",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e179fd853cd8427387a4f12a2e1c7b7af1e5e40df297e3104af180aee6d5e3c6",
      "text": "Jade steps into class.\n“I want to dance!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "01f2eceee7bafb562507c8615c0c6444989e238f491994c5d9a16c60384f5f7a",
      "text": "Soft shoes.\nA green skirt.\n“My ears are ready, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0ffba6f69da1444c5682eea7ac7ef487b35fa3cdb34fffd740f724676da75d0a",
      "text": "The teacher plays a tune.\n“Step with me.”\nStep, step, step.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "85879969df9d2655542e8bd0fde93c17377c971401f13165cf6f727aa3758afb",
      "text": "Jade hops up high.\n“Oops! That was a hop.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ef6b89a3c66ae21bd46d8842c3b19dc8122a96011a1e3a327d3840dc3c6c6067",
      "text": "“Try small steps,” says the\nteacher.\nJade steps with Chang’e.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5ab7726b1ec133ae1d78a1b22ccaafd0fd59209905e53d5315aee83407f9de49",
      "text": "Slow feet.\nSoft feet.\nThey move to the beat.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "98f060a899d6dd66f551ecd0755956c4f5463c389964d41c5ae5ea61bbb59c2f",
      "text": "The music stops.\nJade stops.\nHer ears keep dancing!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "de995abb827bd6b0a428f5f79178ad1b28ce7eb79037fd39daa6c7410449a239",
      "text": "“Turn slowly,” says the\nteacher.\nJade makes a small turn.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f5d674a4dc4418257c4630abcfaf7184a2ac5398ac20c327ef8a0ce90077b8a2",
      "text": "Chang’e turns the other way.\n“Oh! Hello, Jade!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2e9b24c4065c3672c0ea4c3cca6ba13f191c77f2bfc70ea4d43920b5f7007019",
      "text": "They giggle.\nThey try again.\n“Small steps. A slow turn.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "486ae205568143c1a62f662fe5c4dae710d3439ac82f8fc029d99b887de33e88",
      "text": "Now Jade listens to the beat.\nStep, step.\nTurn, turn.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d2b6afb95dd63ca90a0e7103c2cb28215db4c4052c46434b3816a41c3dafa7ce",
      "text": "“And stop!”\nTwo friends stop.\nTwo ears wobble.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0169d1c817c9355f2a6ca0a30dd59b51f17a4cd199d480b63a31317def4c4594",
      "text": "“Let’s dance it all!”\nSmall steps. A slow turn.\nAnd stop!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "18ff2f3cd53f39a77f6de4f26272ab6f55217ce81e229b40ab122acd8fb6951e",
      "text": "“We did it!” says Jade.\nChang’e smiles and claps.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "37f0fc9a046794df886c960e05d4fd2dbca4d97458cc6fa8382804575a00e2f7",
      "text": "Jade takes a little bow.\nHer ears bow, too.\n“One more dance?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6f14abd05c0cd0e1ecc06a7a775d666ab6e243347598fcce36a91498c2c38c0",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed this story, you are welcome\nto support more. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStory and art made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
